{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00054","headline":"谒幷州大兴国寺诗 · 太宗皇帝","name":"谒幷州大兴国寺诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回銮游福地，极目玩芳晨。\n梵钟交二响，法日转双轮。\n宝刹遥承露，天花近足春。\n未佩兰犹小，无丝柳尚新。\n圆光低月殿，碎影乱风筠。\n对此留余想，超然离俗尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}